BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Instant replay</h1>
A delta-glider in orbit fires its main engine. The script enters the
replay, shows an earlier moment and checks the vessel's recorded state
there, then returns to the live state, which must be restored exactly.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/ReplayTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-R
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-R
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-R:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 6671000.0 0.00000 51.6 30.0 0.0 100.0 51982.6685767396
  AROT 0 0 0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
  NAVFREQ 0 0
END
END_SHIPS
